@startuml autonomous-capability-value-stream-boundary
title Autonomous Capability vs Autonomous Value Stream Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Autonomous Capability" as acap
class "Autonomous Value Stream" as avs

acap --> avs : enables (where canonical)

note right of acap
  Capability-level autonomy
  (enduring ability)
end note

note right of avs
  End-to-end autonomous value realization
  (does NOT automatically make
  every enabling Capability autonomous)
end note

note bottom
  Distinct semantic kinds
  per ADR-ES-013 §11
  per ACAP-AUTO-CON-016 + ACAP-AUTO-NEG-013
end note
@enduml
